to see him anymore.

997
01:03:33,518 --> 01:03:38,647
Oh, okay! Who the hell do you think
you are, my father?! Dude!

998
01:03:38,856 --> 01:03:41,149
- Don't walk away from me.
- You're a freak.

999
01:03:41,359 --> 01:03:42,818
Margaret Sarah O'Donnell!

1000
